1
00:00:06,850 --> 00:00:09,640
=The Forgotten Concubine's Revenge=

2
00:00:09,890 --> 00:00:12,710
=Episode 24=

3
00:00:12,890 --> 00:00:15,720
(You've become far too bold!)

4
00:00:19,920 --> 00:00:21,320
(Whatever you say.)

5
00:00:22,040 --> 00:00:23,160
(It's all)

6
00:00:23,160 --> 00:00:25,080
(because of women
fighting in the harem.)

7
00:00:26,440 --> 00:00:28,280
(The Noble Consort abuses her power,)

8
00:00:28,600 --> 00:00:29,680
(treating lives as worthless.)

9
00:00:30,520 --> 00:00:32,160
(Zhaoyi Shen stops at nothing,)

10
00:00:32,320 --> 00:00:33,320
(cold and ruthless.)

11
00:00:34,760 --> 00:00:36,360
(How could I blame)

12
00:00:36,960 --> 00:00:38,960
(a little child for all this?)

13
00:00:50,160 --> 00:00:50,720
Your Highness.

14
00:00:50,840 --> 00:00:52,960
Physician Li has sent this medicine.

15
00:01:11,040 --> 00:01:11,840
Jinxuan.

16
00:01:12,360 --> 00:01:13,880
Drink this and you'll be fine.

17
00:01:14,840 --> 00:01:15,640
Drink it,

18
00:01:16,120 --> 00:01:17,360
and you won't feel so bad.

19
00:01:22,120 --> 00:01:22,920
Jinxuan.

20
00:01:23,880 --> 00:01:25,000
Don't blame me.

21
00:01:26,000 --> 00:01:27,120
Compared to being sent away

22
00:01:27,120 --> 00:01:28,480
to that savage land,

23
00:01:29,520 --> 00:01:30,720
this little suffering

24
00:01:31,000 --> 00:01:32,040
is nothing.

25
00:01:32,840 --> 00:01:34,240
You'll sleep for a few days.

26
00:01:34,600 --> 00:01:35,680
When you wake up,

27
00:01:36,000 --> 00:01:38,640
I will protect you with my life.

28
00:01:39,360 --> 00:01:40,600
I won't let you

29
00:01:41,600 --> 00:01:43,000
suffer another bit of hardship.

30
00:01:45,360 --> 00:01:46,000
Here.

31
00:02:46,520 --> 00:02:47,160
Your Highness.

32
00:02:47,360 --> 00:02:48,040
It's late.

33
00:02:48,040 --> 00:02:48,920
Where are you going?

34
00:02:49,240 --> 00:02:50,400
Take care of the princess.

35
00:02:50,640 --> 00:02:51,920
I have something urgent

36
00:02:52,120 --> 00:02:52,880
to attend to.

37
00:02:53,240 --> 00:02:53,800
Your Highness.

38
00:02:54,480 --> 00:02:56,040
I know what you're going to do.

39
00:02:56,320 --> 00:02:57,560
But if you go,

40
00:02:57,640 --> 00:02:58,720
I'm afraid...

41
00:02:58,880 --> 00:02:59,520
What if...

42
00:02:59,600 --> 00:03:00,440
There are no what-ifs.

43
00:03:01,280 --> 00:03:02,000
Some things

44
00:03:02,560 --> 00:03:03,640
even when you know you can't,

45
00:03:03,720 --> 00:03:04,680
must still be done.

46
00:03:05,440 --> 00:03:06,400
I'm not just

47
00:03:06,680 --> 00:03:07,680
saving Jinxuan.

48
00:03:08,240 --> 00:03:09,720
I'm saving everyone

49
00:03:11,520 --> 00:03:13,280
in this harem who's waiting for dawn.

50
00:03:18,000 --> 00:03:19,280
If I don't make it back,

51
00:03:19,720 --> 00:03:21,040
take Jinxuan

52
00:03:21,040 --> 00:03:22,320
to Concubine Rou for protection.

53
00:03:23,080 --> 00:03:24,040
She has a kind heart.

54
00:03:24,320 --> 00:03:25,360
She'll protect you.

55
00:03:26,960 --> 00:03:27,760
Yes.

56
00:03:36,977 --> 00:03:39,970
(Imperial Study)

57
00:03:52,000 --> 00:03:52,920
Your Highness.

58
00:03:53,080 --> 00:03:55,240
His Majesty is occupied with
state affairs.

59
00:03:55,360 --> 00:03:57,680
I'm afraid he can't see you tonight.

60
00:04:01,160 --> 00:04:01,840
Eunuch Liu.

61
00:04:02,160 --> 00:04:04,080
Please announce me once more.

62
00:04:04,320 --> 00:04:05,320
I have something urgent

63
00:04:05,760 --> 00:04:07,080
to report to His Majesty.

64
00:04:07,320 --> 00:04:09,160
I must see him tonight.

65
00:05:13,720 --> 00:05:14,360
Consort Rong.

66
00:05:14,840 --> 00:05:15,680
At this hour,

67
00:05:16,120 --> 00:05:17,320
what's so urgent?

68
00:05:21,320 --> 00:05:22,640
I beg Your Majesty

69
00:05:23,240 --> 00:05:24,640
to cancel the marriage alliance.

70
00:05:27,400 --> 00:05:29,280
Do you know what you're saying?

71
00:05:33,920 --> 00:05:34,920
I do.

72
00:05:35,560 --> 00:05:37,040
I'm begging Your Majesty

73
00:05:37,640 --> 00:05:39,800
not to send Princess Xihe away.

74
00:05:40,720 --> 00:05:41,520
How dare you!

75
00:05:42,120 --> 00:05:43,240
My decisions

76
00:05:43,320 --> 00:05:44,680
are not for you to question.

77
00:05:46,600 --> 00:05:47,320
Your Majesty.

78
00:05:47,840 --> 00:05:48,800
I know

79
00:05:49,040 --> 00:05:50,960
meddling in state affairs
is a capital crime.

80
00:05:51,360 --> 00:05:52,520
But I must speak.

81
00:05:53,880 --> 00:05:54,440
Guards.

82
00:05:55,080 --> 00:05:56,000
Take her away.

83
00:05:56,240 --> 00:05:57,400
Return her to the Jinghe Palace.

84
00:05:57,560 --> 00:05:58,360
Yes.

85
00:05:59,160 --> 00:06:00,600
Your Majesty!

86
00:06:01,520 --> 00:06:02,440
The safety of the royal family,

87
00:06:02,440 --> 00:06:03,800
the people, the peace of the world...

88
00:06:03,800 --> 00:06:04,880
Can it really

89
00:06:04,880 --> 00:06:06,920
depend on a girl barely in her teens?

90
00:06:07,000 --> 00:06:08,520
She's your own daughter!

91
00:06:16,400 --> 00:06:17,200
Your Majesty.

92
00:06:17,800 --> 00:06:19,400
Xihe is your daughter.

93
00:06:19,800 --> 00:06:21,000
You are her father.

94
00:06:21,320 --> 00:06:22,320
Do you truly

95
00:06:22,560 --> 00:06:24,800
feel no paternal love for her?

96
00:06:25,600 --> 00:06:26,920
This alliance, in the end,

97
00:06:28,080 --> 00:06:29,040
isn't it just sending

98
00:06:29,040 --> 00:06:30,960
your own daughter to a savage tribe

99
00:06:31,120 --> 00:06:33,040
to buy a moment's peace?

100
00:06:33,640 --> 00:06:35,560
Aren't you afraid the world
will mock you?

101
00:06:36,360 --> 00:06:37,320
Mock me?

102
00:06:38,360 --> 00:06:39,200
Well said.

103
00:06:40,760 --> 00:06:42,000
I am a father,

104
00:06:42,560 --> 00:06:44,200
but I am also the Son of Heaven.

105
00:06:44,680 --> 00:06:45,480
As the Son of Heaven,

106
00:06:45,880 --> 00:06:47,600
I must put the realm first.

107
00:06:47,840 --> 00:06:48,840
Can family ties

108
00:06:48,840 --> 00:06:50,360
ever outweigh the lives of millions?

109
00:06:50,480 --> 00:06:52,440
If one princess can stop a war,

110
00:06:52,720 --> 00:06:54,240
we can spare our troops from battle,

111
00:06:54,560 --> 00:06:55,480
avoid burdening the people,

112
00:06:55,480 --> 00:06:57,000
and save countless lives.

113
00:06:57,000 --> 00:06:57,680
What would you do

114
00:06:57,680 --> 00:06:58,520
in my place?

115
00:07:02,640 --> 00:07:05,320
If you cannot even
protect your own daughter,

116
00:07:06,360 --> 00:07:07,400
what good is

117
00:07:08,480 --> 00:07:09,760
this realm to you?

118
00:07:11,680 --> 00:07:12,880
If today

119
00:07:13,160 --> 00:07:14,800
you send Xihe away,

120
00:07:15,040 --> 00:07:16,480
then if the enemy comes again,

121
00:07:17,000 --> 00:07:18,480
who will you send next?

122
00:07:19,160 --> 00:07:20,040
Jinxuan?

123
00:07:21,520 --> 00:07:22,480
Or me?

124
00:07:24,400 --> 00:07:25,280
This realm

125
00:07:25,280 --> 00:07:28,000
was never held up by women's skirts.

126
00:07:28,560 --> 00:07:29,960
It stands on men's blood,

127
00:07:30,080 --> 00:07:31,440
the courage of our court,

128
00:07:31,440 --> 00:07:33,600
and the dignity of our people.

129
00:07:34,280 --> 00:07:35,240
Your Majesty.

130
00:07:35,800 --> 00:07:36,680
Please reconsider.

131
00:07:38,840 --> 00:07:39,720
Very well.

132
00:07:41,200 --> 00:07:42,680
Since you

133
00:07:43,200 --> 00:07:44,960
insist on pleading for Xihe,

134
00:07:45,280 --> 00:07:46,720
I'll grant your request.

135
00:07:48,000 --> 00:07:49,320
Xihe won't have to go.

136
00:07:50,840 --> 00:07:51,880
I've heard

137
00:07:52,000 --> 00:07:53,400
Jinxuan is nearly recovered.

138
00:07:53,880 --> 00:07:54,840
In that case,

139
00:07:55,200 --> 00:07:56,560
Jinxuan will take her place

140
00:07:56,760 --> 00:07:58,120
and marry into Beijie.

141
00:07:58,480 --> 00:07:59,280
Your Majesty.

142
00:07:59,960 --> 00:08:01,920
How can you treat this like a game?

143
00:08:02,120 --> 00:08:04,640
Don't think I don't know
what you've been up to.

144
00:08:04,800 --> 00:08:06,280
Why did Jinxuan fall ill so suddenly,

145
00:08:06,440 --> 00:08:07,800
then recover so strangely?

146
00:08:08,320 --> 00:08:11,040
It's all your secret fight
with Concubine Qi.

147
00:08:11,680 --> 00:08:12,680
In the end,

148
00:08:13,320 --> 00:08:15,360
it's all for your own selfish ends.

149
00:08:15,880 --> 00:08:18,280
How dare you lecture me like this?

150
00:08:18,720 --> 00:08:20,040
This is deceiving the sovereign.

151
00:08:20,480 --> 00:08:22,720
You've become far too bold!

152
00:08:24,800 --> 00:08:25,720
I wouldn't dare.

153
00:08:25,920 --> 00:08:26,720
Guards.

154
00:08:27,320 --> 00:08:28,560
Send Consort Rong back.

155
00:08:28,800 --> 00:08:29,760
If she dares offend me again,

156
00:08:29,880 --> 00:08:30,800
she'll be severely punished.

157
00:08:31,320 --> 00:08:32,520
As for Li Chengyan
of the Imperial Hospital,

158
00:08:32,720 --> 00:08:33,840
strip him of his post
as Deputy Director.

159
00:08:34,000 --> 00:08:34,840
Await further orders!

160
00:08:35,360 --> 00:08:36,160
Yes.

161
00:08:36,880 --> 00:08:38,400
Your Majesty!

162
00:08:38,960 --> 00:08:41,280
Please don't send the princess away!

163
00:08:41,960 --> 00:08:42,760
Your Majesty...

164
00:08:43,053 --> 00:08:45,547
(Xiao'an Palace)

165
00:08:45,600 --> 00:08:47,880
The Empress Dowager is unwell
and will receive no visitors.

166
00:08:48,160 --> 00:08:49,520
Please return, Your Highness.

167
00:08:52,080 --> 00:08:53,800
Your Highness.

168
00:08:54,360 --> 00:08:56,160
Please, have mercy on the princess.

169
00:08:56,520 --> 00:08:58,000
Your own Princess Duanjing

170
00:08:58,280 --> 00:08:59,720
was sent away for a marriage alliance,

171
00:09:00,280 --> 00:09:01,400
and died in a foreign land.

172
00:09:01,840 --> 00:09:03,760
Will you really stand by and

173
00:09:04,120 --> 00:09:05,600
watch tragedy repeat itself,

174
00:09:05,880 --> 00:09:08,560
(Xiao'an Palace)
and let your own granddaughter die, too?

175
00:09:08,560 --> 00:09:09,120
(Xiao'an Palace)
Silence!

176
00:09:14,840 --> 00:09:15,640
Your Highness.

177
00:09:19,080 --> 00:09:19,880
Your Highness.

178
00:09:20,560 --> 00:09:21,520
Princess Duanjing

179
00:09:22,080 --> 00:09:23,800
was your most beloved daughter.

180
00:09:24,080 --> 00:09:25,440
When she was sent away,

181
00:09:25,840 --> 00:09:27,280
your heart was broken.

182
00:09:27,800 --> 00:09:29,440
When she died in a foreign land,

183
00:09:29,760 --> 00:09:31,000
you grieved so deeply

184
00:09:31,000 --> 00:09:32,080
you fell gravely ill.

185
00:09:32,280 --> 00:09:34,040
Now Jinxuan and Xihe are still so young.

186
00:09:34,040 --> 00:09:34,960
They know so little,

187
00:09:34,960 --> 00:09:36,560
yet they're being sent down
the same path.

188
00:09:37,240 --> 00:09:37,840
Your Highness.

189
00:09:39,040 --> 00:09:40,480
Can you truly bear it?

190
00:09:42,440 --> 00:09:44,080
How dare you! Silence!

191
00:09:45,760 --> 00:09:47,120
Princess Duanjing

192
00:09:47,240 --> 00:09:50,280
(Xiao'an Palace)
was indeed my most beloved daughter.

193
00:09:51,600 --> 00:09:54,120
When she left me all those years ago,

194
00:09:55,920 --> 00:09:57,200
she was only this tall.

195
00:09:58,880 --> 00:10:00,320
She wasn't much older

196
00:10:01,040 --> 00:10:02,400
than Jinxuan and the others.

197
00:10:04,400 --> 00:10:06,800
Though the late Emperor and His Majesty

198
00:10:07,880 --> 00:10:09,560
forbid anyone to speak of it,

199
00:10:10,440 --> 00:10:11,840
I...

200
00:10:13,240 --> 00:10:14,920
I know everything.

201
00:10:17,280 --> 00:10:18,680
That savage land...

202
00:10:19,120 --> 00:10:22,320
The misery of dying far from home...

203
00:10:23,080 --> 00:10:25,240
My poor daughter...

204
00:10:27,320 --> 00:10:28,880
I can't forget

205
00:10:30,720 --> 00:10:32,280
the tears in her eyes

206
00:10:34,000 --> 00:10:37,120
as she said goodbye.

207
00:10:41,760 --> 00:10:43,720
(Xiao'an Palace)
What good will it do

208
00:10:44,080 --> 00:10:45,360
for you to come to me today?

209
00:10:46,400 --> 00:10:47,120
Your Highness.

210
00:10:47,600 --> 00:10:48,920
Have you read the Admonitions for Women?

211
00:10:50,160 --> 00:10:51,200
The Book of Rites says,

212
00:10:51,680 --> 00:10:52,480
a woman

213
00:10:52,880 --> 00:10:54,240
must obey others.

214
00:10:54,800 --> 00:10:56,120
In youth, she obeys
her father and brothers.

215
00:10:56,880 --> 00:10:58,120
In marriage, her husband.

216
00:10:58,480 --> 00:11:00,120
When widowed, her son.

217
00:11:01,000 --> 00:11:01,760
This...

218
00:11:02,400 --> 00:11:04,240
Is a woman's fate.

219
00:11:04,640 --> 00:11:06,760
If you know women's fate is so bitter,

220
00:11:07,240 --> 00:11:08,720
why not stand up

221
00:11:08,720 --> 00:11:09,960
and fight for change?

222
00:11:10,640 --> 00:11:12,080
How can you stand by

223
00:11:12,400 --> 00:11:13,560
and only afterward

224
00:11:13,760 --> 00:11:15,040
lament the sorrow?

225
00:11:16,480 --> 00:11:17,320
Back then,

226
00:11:17,760 --> 00:11:19,920
when Princess Duanjing was sent away,

227
00:11:20,480 --> 00:11:23,160
I knelt outside the Imperial Study,

228
00:11:23,600 --> 00:11:25,480
begging just as you are now.

229
00:11:26,280 --> 00:11:27,200
But...

230
00:11:31,440 --> 00:11:32,200
Consort Rong.

231
00:11:33,400 --> 00:11:34,920
Let me tell you this.

232
00:11:35,240 --> 00:11:36,840
The women of this harem

233
00:11:37,200 --> 00:11:38,400
may seem privileged,

234
00:11:38,680 --> 00:11:39,520
but in truth,

235
00:11:40,120 --> 00:11:42,160
they've never controlled
their own fates.

236
00:11:43,040 --> 00:11:44,640
Even a princess,

237
00:11:44,960 --> 00:11:45,720
a Noble Consort,

238
00:11:46,080 --> 00:11:49,000
or even me, the Empress Dowager,

239
00:11:50,360 --> 00:11:52,240
we are powerless.

240
00:11:54,160 --> 00:11:57,920
I couldn't protect my beloved daughter.

241
00:11:58,760 --> 00:12:00,120
She ended up

242
00:12:00,560 --> 00:12:02,320
dying in a foreign land.

243
00:12:04,440 --> 00:12:06,440
What could I do?

244
00:12:10,080 --> 00:12:11,400
Go back.

245
00:12:11,720 --> 00:12:12,400
Your Highness.

246
00:12:12,640 --> 00:12:13,920
There must be something you can do.

247
00:12:14,120 --> 00:12:15,240
There must be.

248
00:12:15,680 --> 00:12:16,840
Since ancient times,

249
00:12:17,400 --> 00:12:18,960
the harem may not
meddle in state affairs.

250
00:12:19,400 --> 00:12:20,440
It is an ancestral rule

251
00:12:20,760 --> 00:12:21,720
that cannot be broken.

252
00:12:22,680 --> 00:12:24,600
Don't come here today

253
00:12:24,720 --> 00:12:25,840
spewing such nonsense

254
00:12:26,080 --> 00:12:27,320
and making a scene.

255
00:12:27,360 --> 00:12:28,160
Your Highness.

256
00:12:28,520 --> 00:12:29,640
I beg you.

257
00:12:29,720 --> 00:12:30,520
Guards.

258
00:12:31,320 --> 00:12:33,640
Consort Rong has
meddled in state affairs.

259
00:12:33,840 --> 00:12:34,640
By palace rules,

260
00:12:35,160 --> 00:12:36,480
give her thirty strokes.

261
00:12:36,480 --> 00:12:38,000
(Xiao'an Palace)

262
00:12:38,240 --> 00:12:38,960
Your Highness.

263
00:12:39,160 --> 00:12:39,880
Your Highness.

264
00:12:40,080 --> 00:12:40,800
Your Highness.

265
00:12:41,200 --> 00:12:41,920
Your Highness!

266
00:13:03,064 --> 00:13:07,985
(Xiao'an Palace)

267
00:13:08,920 --> 00:13:09,720
Your Majesty!

268
00:13:10,240 --> 00:13:10,920
Your Majesty!

269
00:13:11,040 --> 00:13:13,040
Please save Consort Rong!

270
00:13:13,040 --> 00:13:13,840
Your Majesty!

271
00:13:14,720 --> 00:13:15,760
Your Majesty!

272
00:13:15,920 --> 00:13:17,720
I beg to see Your Majesty!

273
00:13:18,440 --> 00:13:19,080
Your Majesty.

274
00:13:19,280 --> 00:13:20,360
It's Concubine Rou.

275
00:13:20,480 --> 00:13:21,640
She's outside in the palace corridor,

276
00:13:21,960 --> 00:13:23,000
weeping and demanding to see you.

277
00:13:23,200 --> 00:13:24,040
She says it's urgent.

278
00:13:24,560 --> 00:13:25,960
We can't hold her back.

279
00:13:27,280 --> 00:13:28,080
Your Majesty.

280
00:13:28,160 --> 00:13:30,240
The Empress Dowager
has punished Consort Rong.

281
00:13:30,360 --> 00:13:32,320
She's being beaten right now.

282
00:13:32,800 --> 00:13:35,160
Please save her, Your Majesty!

283
00:13:35,400 --> 00:13:36,360
Your Majesty.

284
00:13:37,080 --> 00:13:38,200
By my decree.

285
00:13:39,360 --> 00:13:41,160
Concubine Rou intruded on
the Imperial Study,

286
00:13:41,680 --> 00:13:42,840
spoke against the Empress Dowager,

287
00:13:43,040 --> 00:13:44,080
and meddled in the harem.

288
00:13:44,600 --> 00:13:45,120
She is to be

289
00:13:45,560 --> 00:13:46,680
confined to the Yongxiu Palace,

290
00:13:47,280 --> 00:13:48,520
not to leave without a decree.

291
00:13:49,080 --> 00:13:49,720
Yes.

292
00:13:50,120 --> 00:13:50,920
Your Majesty!

293
00:13:54,680 --> 00:13:55,480
Take her away.

294
00:13:55,720 --> 00:13:56,240
No.

295
00:13:56,440 --> 00:13:56,960
No!

296
00:13:56,960 --> 00:13:58,000
Don't take me away!

297
00:13:58,360 --> 00:13:59,160
Your Majesty.

298
00:13:59,680 --> 00:14:00,400
Your Majesty!

299
00:14:01,200 --> 00:14:02,840
I must see His Majesty!

300
00:14:03,080 --> 00:14:04,360
Your Majesty!

301
00:14:11,643 --> 00:14:16,283
♪I've wandered through this world
all my life♪

302
00:14:16,653 --> 00:14:21,133
♪As the years go by,
we learn to be alone♪

303
00:14:21,563 --> 00:14:25,843
♪I see leaves fall from the old tree
by my window♪

304
00:14:26,283 --> 00:14:30,763
♪When flowers bloom and swallows return,
I hope you are still here♪

305
00:14:31,203 --> 00:14:35,523
♪I hear rain whisper in my ear♪

306
00:14:36,103 --> 00:14:40,563
♪I send my longing to you far away♪

307
00:14:40,903 --> 00:14:45,363
♪I wait for dawn to break the mist
and you to find your way home♪

308
00:14:45,783 --> 00:14:50,283
♪Let the stars and sea
wait for your return♪

309
00:14:50,573 --> 00:14:55,043
♪Let the stars and sea
wait for your return♪

310
00:14:55,623 --> 00:14:58,760
♪Let the stars and sea♪

311
00:14:58,760 --> 00:15:00,200
(Changsheng Gate)

312
00:15:00,200 --> 00:15:04,533
♪Wait for your return♪
